    "captions": [
      {
        "text": "使用已获授权的谷歌账号登录。",
        "startMs": 200,
        "endMs": 2917,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "在视频工作室搜索抖音，选择一到五个参考视频。",
        "startMs": 2917,
        "endMs": 7187,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "参考素材只用于学习剪辑方法。",
        "startMs": 7187,
        "endMs": 9903,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "上传三十秒到三分钟的自有竖屏视频。",
        "startMs": 10567,
        "endMs": 13903,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "填写项目名称和脚本，并确认你拥有素材的编辑权限。",
        "startMs": 13903,
        "endMs": 18614,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "选择主题和内容语言，填写目标",
        "startMs": 19267,
        "endMs": 22220,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "受众、表达风格与品牌要求。",
        "startMs": 22220,
        "endMs": 24962,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "设置费用上限，然后点击分析并生成计划。",
        "startMs": 24962,
        "endMs": 28970,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "先查看参考视频分析，再打开剪辑计划。",
        "startMs": 29633,
        "endMs": 33233,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "对照自有素材逐条检查建议，批准有用的",
        "startMs": 33233,
        "endMs": 36833,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "改动，锁定需要保留的决策，并保存计划。",
        "startMs": 36833,
        "endMs": 40633,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "想换一种剪法？",
        "startMs": 41300,
        "endMs": 42773,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "选择未锁定的决策，说明修改方向，再生成备选方案。",
        "startMs": 42773,
        "endMs": 47823,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "确认合适后替换，其他决策保持不变。",
        "startMs": 47823,
        "endMs": 51399,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "制作已批准的计划，然后观看主版本预览。",
        "startMs": 52067,
        "endMs": 56272,
        "timestampMs": null,
        "confidence": null
      },
      {
        "text": "亲自检查画面、语音和字幕。",
